WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:06.206 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(sirènes de police)

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:07.574 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 C'est le procès du siècle,

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:08.908 size:53% position:73% line:53%
diront certains.

00:00:06.306 --> 00:00:10.310 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Un procès sous haute

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:11.644 size:53% position:73% line:53%
surveillance et très médiatisé.

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:13.046 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il y a la guerre en Ukraine,

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:14.380 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le droit à l'avortement remis

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:15.749 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en question. Mais enen à faire:

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:17.117 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ce qui fascine les Américains,

00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:18.451 size:53% position:73% line:53%
c'est ce procès en diffamation

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:19.819 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que mène Johnny Depp contre

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:21.187 size:53% position:73% line:53%
son ex-femme, Amber Heard.

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:22.555 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Johnny!

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:23.923 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(acclamations)

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:25.258 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Chaque jour depuis le 11 avril,

00:00:22.656 --> 00:00:26.626 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ses fans sont nombreux devant

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:27.994 size:53% position:73% line:53%
leriribunal, iPhone à la main,

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:29.362 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour immortaliser ce moment :

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:30.730 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Johnny Depp qui les salue

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:32.065 size:53% position:73% line:53%
avec le sourire.

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:33.466 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(sirènes de police)

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:34.834 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- "It's Johnny Depp!"

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:40.340 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(rire)

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:40.340 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- "Let's take a break.

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:40.340 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Let's go see Johnny Depp!"

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:48.915 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Mais à l'intérieur de la cour,

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:50.283 size:53% position:73% line:53%
il n'y a rien de joyeux.

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:51.651 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Amber Heard l'accuse

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:53.053 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de violence physique,

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:54.387 size:53% position:73% line:53%
psychologique, verbale,

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:55.755 size:53% position:73% line:53%
surtout déclenchée lors d'une

00:00:53.153 --> 00:00:57.123 size:53% position:73% line:53%
forte consommation d'alcool

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:58.491 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et de drogue.

00:00:55.855 --> 00:01:01.361 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Depuis un mois, leur vie privée

00:00:57.223 --> 00:01:02.729 size:53% position:73% line:53%
est devenue publique. Tout est

00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:07.767 size:53% position:73% line:53%
relaté dans les moindres détaila

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:07.767 size:53% position:73% line:53%
télévision, avec vidéos et audio

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:07.767 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à l'appui. Le public se délecte.

00:01:11.437 --> 00:01:15.408 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"Tout leur linge sale est exposé

00:01:12.806 --> 00:01:21.381 size:53% position:73% line:53%
devant le monde entier",

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:22.716 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dit cette avocate qui couvre

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:28.922 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le procès depuis le début.

00:01:21.481 --> 00:01:28.922 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"Il s'agit de diffamation,

00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:28.922 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dit-elle. Et tout repose surqui.

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:35.995 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"Je ne l'aime pas, c'est

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:36.029 size:53% position:73% line:53%
une menteuse," dit-elle.

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:36.062 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "Elle pleure, mais elle n'a pas

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:40.734 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de larmes" dit la pancarte.

00:01:41.134 --> 00:01:45.105 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "Nous n'étions pas là,

00:01:42.468 --> 00:01:46.473 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dit-il. On n'est pas en mesure

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:47.807 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de juger, comme société.

00:01:45.205 --> 00:01:53.113 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il y a un système pour cela."

00:01:46.573 --> 00:01:53.113 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Mais chaque avocat a son point

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:53.113 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de vue.

00:01:56.216 --> 00:02:00.220 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"Les personnes qui prétendent

00:01:57.584 --> 00:02:01.588 size:53% position:73% line:53%
être victimes de violences

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:02.956 size:53% position:73% line:53%
conjugales sont extrêmement

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:04.324 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dangereuses," dit-elle" pour

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:05.658 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les vraies victimes."

00:02:03.056 --> 00:02:07.060 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "Son histoire ne tient pas"

00:02:04.424 --> 00:02:08.428 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dit-elle. "Amber Heard n'a pas

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:09.762 size:53% position:73% line:53%
toujours porté plaelelelelelle

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:11.131 size:53% position:73% line:53%
refuse des soins médicaux, alors

00:02:08.528 --> 00:02:12.499 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qu'elle aurait subi des graves

00:02:09.863 --> 00:02:13.867 size:53% position:73% line:53%
blessures".

00:02:11.231 --> 00:02:15.235 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Et c'est ce que Johnny Depp

00:02:12.599 --> 00:02:16.603 size:53% position:73% line:53%
essaie de prouver, qu'Amber

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:17.971 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Heard n'a pas dit la vérité.

00:02:15.335 --> 00:02:19.339 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Selon l'acteur, elle n'a fait

00:02:16.703 --> 00:02:20.707 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que ternir sa réputation et lui

00:02:18.037 --> 00:02:26.412 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ererererererdre plusieurs contrs

00:02:19.439 --> 00:02:27.780 size:53% position:73% line:53%
importants, dont celui du film

00:02:20.807 --> 00:02:29.149 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"Pirates des Caraïbes".

00:02:26.513 --> 00:02:30.516 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"Quelle que soit l'issue

00:02:27.881 --> 00:02:31.851 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du procès, dit-il je vais vivre

00:02:29.249 --> 00:02:33.219 size:53% position:73% line:53%
avec ça pour le reste

00:02:30.617 --> 00:02:34.587 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de mes jours." Il nie avoir levé

00:02:31.951 --> 00:02:40.794 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la main sur elle et réclame

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:40.794 size:53% position:73% line:53%
50 millions de dollars

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:40.794 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en dommages et intérêts.

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:47.667 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "Le pendule du mouvement #MeToo

00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:49.035 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ne balançait que d'un côté,

00:02:46.399 --> 00:02:50.370 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dit cette avocate. Beaucoup

00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:51.738 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'hommes ont été

00:02:49.135 --> 00:02:53.106 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de violence conjugale,

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:54.574 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et certains étaient juste

00:02:51.838 --> 00:02:55.909 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pris dans ce mouvement et

00:02:53.206 --> 00:02:57.277 size:53% position:73% line:53%
n'ont pas eu la possibilité

00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:58.645 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de se défendreen court. Johnny

00:02:56.009 --> 00:03:04.050 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Depp a décidé de riposter,

00:02:57.377 --> 00:03:04.050 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en se présentant aussi comme

00:02:58.745 --> 00:03:04.050 size:53% position:73% line:53%
une victime" dit-elle.

00:03:09.522 --> 00:03:14.994 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Avec cette poursuite,

00:03:10.857 --> 00:03:19.799 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Johnny Depp aura semé le douten,

00:03:13.726 --> 00:03:21.134 size:53% position:73% line:53%
il a déjà remporté la bataille

00:03:15.094 --> 00:03:22.502 size:53% position:73% line:53%
populaire.

00:03:19.899 --> 00:03:23.870 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Le contre-interrogatoire

00:03:21.234 --> 00:03:25.238 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'Amber Heard débute le 16 mai

00:03:22.602 --> 00:03:26.606 size:53% position:73% line:53%
prochain.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.806 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Iciororororororororghis,

00:03:25.338 --> 00:03:26.806 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Radio-Canada, Fairfax,

00:03:26.706 --> 00:03:26.806 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Virgini

